      "content": "Thanks for that, but I think the marketing team is going to think that's a bit too short. The score is only at 3 right now (Smart Pipeline, Automated Follow-ups, Goal Tracking). \n\nThey really want to see these emails flagged as \"High Value,\" and in our system, that usually means a much higher feature count. Can you try a version that incorporates more of the features from the list? Just try to get that score up as high as possible while still keeping it professional.",
